  "body": "I have seen the specification mentions about the broadcaster and the observer roles; however, I didn't found the `BluetoothDevice` object contains `tx_power` (this might be a standalone service, but observer might want to know this without making a connection), `rssi`, and `serviceData` ( in `Supplement to Bluetooth Core Specification - 1.11`) attributes.\n\nShould these attributes be included in `BluetoothDevice` as optional attributes? Is there any other API can retrieve these attributes If they should not stay in `BluetoothDevice`?\n",
